{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1559d0a5-67ab-868e-8c95-be9c7beb5cdf",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T10:23:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilson Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:19:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. [pause] Good morning. My name is Nilson Gomes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:19:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning, Mr. Gomes. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:19:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I need... a zoning certificate. [pause] For my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:19:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is this for a sale, a refinance, something like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:19:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] An attorney. He is handling a family trust. [pause] He asked me to get it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:19:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, that's pretty routine. Which property are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:19:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "467 Bridge Street. [pause] Down the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:20:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "467 Bridge Street, okay. And you're the owner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:20:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Homeowner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:20:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So what are you asking me, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:20:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The fee. [pause] And how long it takes. [pause] The attorney wants to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:20:22-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I can't quote you the fee off the top of my head, I'd rather not give you the wrong number. I can have it confirmed and called back to you. Turnaround is usually a matter of days, not weeks, but it depends on how busy we are and whether the file needs a look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:20:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. [pause] Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:20:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Roughly, yes. Does the attorney need it by a certain date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:21:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know. [pause] I can ask him. [pause] He did not say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:21:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. If he does have a deadline, tell us when you submit the request. Do you have the request form yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:21:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] I do not have it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:21:26-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a short request. You can pick one up at the counter here at City Hall, or the attorney's office may be able to send you one. Either way we'll need the address and your name as owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:21:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can come. [pause] Today maybe. [pause] Or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:21:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. We're open regular weekday hours. Is there a good time for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:22:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoon is better. [pause] The school... the district posted a new schedule. [pause] For the winter break. [pause] I have to pick up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:22:14-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so afternoon is tight for you. Then come in this morning or early tomorrow if you can, and I'll make sure someone has the form ready for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:22:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow morning. [pause] That is good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:22:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow morning, fine. And what's the best number to reach you with the fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:22:42-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:22:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-three. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:22:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] That is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:22:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll check on the fee and either call you or have it for you when you come in. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:23:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] That is all. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:23:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Gomes. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:23:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
